{
  "_doc": "GET /api/sync/reminder-context (M3.5). Each case is one profile's stored state document (`state`), the Coach record on disk (`coach`, optional, api/coach/<uid>.json), the `date` asked for and the exact 200 body (`expected`). A case with `now` (ISO) pins the server clock for the 12 h live window and the proposal expiry; the og-api route test replays only the cases without `now`, the unit test replays all of them. `coach_cadence_on` is true when the Coach consent is given and a cadence is set, whether or not a proposal is pending (`coach` null does not imply it false), and false when Coach is switched off on the server. The gains-be contract suite replays this file against its ConditionSource adapter: `state` is og-api's private input and only `date` and `expected` are the wire contract.",
